  "description": "**Original Webtoon:**  \n[BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=170025), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/49927585), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/wavering), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=2718175), [Comico](https://www.comico.kr/comic/2648), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H029967416), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H029967416), MeToon\n\n**Official Translations:**      \n[Japanese](https://www.amazon.co.jp/-/en/dp/B0CKBW7DGQ/) \n\nIt's perfect but poor soil spoon handsome Geum So-hoon, a second-generation chaebol of a large company, Bug Jae-wan! In the meantime, the campus romance story of 23-year-old Wang Seo-yeon and the dangerous office romance between Bul Jae-sang, a director of a large company that is perfect for everything, and Chae Soo-ah, a 30-year-old low-level employee in her fifth year.  \nOur story of being confused in front of love.\"",
